[step] The outer bowed-tube recess ends at absolute X90.850 beside the grip back at X91.000. Its 0.150 mm lateral offset is the edge of a 0.496 mm-deep open recess, backed by the continuous 5.504 mm upper web. It is not the grip's wall thickness; native probes preserve the full grip root and 3 mm finger-pocket backing.
