[step] The flat bowed-tube relief ends 0.496 mm behind the web fore face. The retained upper backing is 5.504 mm thick and joins the complete web; this is the edge of a shallow open recess, not a separate thin wall.
click: x=-74.225 y=108.786 z=214.774

[sliver] These 0.496 mm strips are the exposed side faces of the shallow bowed-tube recess. The material behind the recess is a continuous 5.504 mm backing, verified by the native upper-backing probes in tee_carrier.py.
