[ceiling] The aft shelf's flat underside at Z209.075 runs 14 mm behind the web and clears the inner aft coil cases. Removable support rises 41.901 mm from the bed and leaves through the loose half's open aft face before hardware assembly. The final slice must verify its emitted support bodies.
