[ceiling] The solid grip bar's flat underside at Z175.300 clears the opening's lower edge and the closed enclosure's seam rail by 0.50 mm, including the 0.25 mm supported-surface allowance. The full 16 mm Y section rises from this face. Support reaches the bed 8.126 mm below and is exposed beneath the loose half before assembly.
