[ceiling] Flat underside of the 3 mm aft wall, recessed 3.25 mm behind the exterior face and joined to the backing along its full height. Support reaches the bed 8.126 mm below and is exposed beneath the loose half before assembly.
click: x=-99.125 y=131.790 z=175.300

[slope] The spring channel's tangent 45-degree roof runs along its Y axis and preserves the complete 6.57 mm round passage. It builds without interior support on the Z-up print. This is a bore roof, not a load-bearing seating face.
